1
00:01:32,870 --> 00:01:35,020
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,259 --> 00:01:37,860
[Episode 30]

3
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:40,789
To be honest,

4
00:01:40,789 --> 00:01:42,039
this is too huge a price

5
00:01:42,039 --> 00:01:43,229
to pay

6
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,430
just for Yan Jicai.

7
00:01:46,039 --> 00:01:47,770
I'm not only doing this for him,

8
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,450
but also for legal justice,

9
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:51,680
for my mentor,

10
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,710
and for Yan Jicai's wife

11
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:55,509
and daughter.

12
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,280
I know

13
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,240
if things get out of hand,

14
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,780
you'll be caught in a dilemma.

15
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,430
I'll be fine.

16
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,650
I'm just worried about you.

17
00:02:20,030 --> 00:02:20,760
How about...

18
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,980
How about we get a divorce?

19
00:02:28,530 --> 00:02:31,420
[Meeting Room 1]

20
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:40,190
Hello, Judge Xia.

21
00:02:40,470 --> 00:02:42,150
I'm Hu Xudong's defense lawyer,

22
00:02:42,150 --> 00:02:42,950
Chen Yizhong.

23
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,640
This is my business card,

24
00:02:44,710 --> 00:02:45,910
my license to practice law,

25
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:47,190
the letter of introduction
from my law firm,

26
00:02:47,190 --> 00:02:48,170
and the Defense Authorization Letter.

27
00:02:48,170 --> 00:02:49,230
Please take a look.

28
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:54,960
Hello, Mr. Chen.

29
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:56,340
My name is Xia Yingjie.

30
00:02:56,470 --> 00:02:58,000
I'm the judge for this case.

31
00:02:59,430 --> 00:03:00,030
Judge Xia,

32
00:03:00,970 --> 00:03:03,000
I'm here to apply to review the files,

33
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,190
especially those issued
by the public security bureau

34
00:03:04,190 --> 00:03:06,360
after the supplementary investigation.

35
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,000
Your application is received.

36
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,460
We'll arrange for it soon.

37
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,960
Judge Xia, may I ask

38
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,160
if there's any new evidence?

39
00:03:16,910 --> 00:03:18,340
According to regulations,

40
00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:19,370
defense lawyers

41
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:21,790
can only review and copy certain files.

42
00:03:24,190 --> 00:03:25,090
You see,

43
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,840
there are still many doubts

44
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:27,800
about this case.

45
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:28,630
Besides,

46
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:30,560
the chain of evidence is incomplete.

47
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,840
I deem it unfair

48
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:32,650
to my client

49
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,750
if I can't access

50
00:03:33,750 --> 00:03:34,750
all the evidence.

51
00:03:34,870 --> 00:03:37,030
Plus, the new procedure law
clearly stipulates

52
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,690
According to the Decision on Revising
the Criminal Procedure Law of PRC

53
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,329
that lawyers have the right

54
00:03:37,690 --> 00:03:38,540
approved in the 4th session
of the 8th National People's Congress,

55
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:39,420
to review, copy,

56
00:03:38,540 --> 00:03:39,190
the new Criminal Procedure Law
finished amendment on March 17, 1996,

57
00:03:39,190 --> 00:03:39,850
and was enacted on January 1, 1997.

58
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:40,800
and request to verify evidence.

59
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,520
Mr. Chen,

60
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:43,410
no need to recite the legal articles.

61
00:03:43,410 --> 00:03:45,030
We won't deliberately give you a hard time

62
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:46,490
or any special treatment.

63
00:03:46,770 --> 00:03:49,370
Everything will follow
the new procedure law.

64
00:03:49,430 --> 00:03:51,079
As for anything unclear
about the articles,

65
00:03:51,079 --> 00:03:53,680
the court now has the right
of interpretation.

66
00:03:54,310 --> 00:03:54,710
Okay.

67
00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:04,190
How long have you been waiting?

68
00:04:04,190 --> 00:04:05,050
I just arrived.

69
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:09,400
A joint meeting of the three chiefs.
What a headache.

70
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,120
Hu Xudong's case has dragged on

71
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:11,780
for so long.

72
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:13,430
We're under tremendous public pressure.

73
00:04:13,430 --> 00:04:15,240
Today's meeting was exactly about that.

74
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,390
It's not that we're holding it up.

75
00:04:16,390 --> 00:04:17,620
The procuratorate returned the file first,

76
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:18,870
asking for a supplementary investigation.

77
00:04:18,870 --> 00:04:19,630
But in the end,

78
00:04:19,630 --> 00:04:21,430
it still falls on us, doesn't it?

79
00:04:21,630 --> 00:04:23,630
Anyway, I don't feel great about it.

80
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:25,960
Don't worry. I'll try the case myself.

81
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:28,530
Have you read the file?

82
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:29,120
Yes.

83
00:04:29,950 --> 00:04:31,150
Your hunch was right.

84
00:04:32,150 --> 00:04:32,480
What?

85
00:04:33,390 --> 00:04:34,850
Is the evidence that weak?

86
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:36,920
It depends on how you look at it.

87
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,450
Stop beating around the bush with me.

88
00:04:39,450 --> 00:04:40,250
Just speak up.

89
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:42,350
The chain of evidence is incomplete.

90
00:04:42,350 --> 00:04:43,190
The confession also shows flaws.

91
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:44,360
It's not a serious problem,

92
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,360
nor a trivial one.

93
00:04:46,310 --> 00:04:46,870
Yu,

94
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:50,120
you lack confidence, don't you?

95
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:52,430
I just think

96
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:53,770
that Qian Xingliang's case incurred

97
00:04:53,770 --> 00:04:54,700
too high a price.

98
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,480
The court can't go through it again.

99
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:02,890
I doubt if that'll happen.

100
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,420
At least this time,

101
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:06,160
the victim was dead and buried.

102
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,750
He wouldn't come back alive

103
00:05:07,750 --> 00:05:08,810
like Yu Sanhua did.

104
00:05:09,630 --> 00:05:10,360
In short,

105
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:11,550
make it quick.

106
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,630
Try the case and end it fast.

107
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:14,920
Just make sure you handle the facts

108
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,250
and evidence properly.

109
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:17,510
Now that I'm the presiding judge,

110
00:05:17,510 --> 00:05:18,720
I'll ensure the case is rock-solid

111
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,050
and stands to scrutiny,

112
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:21,720
both now and in the future.

113
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,490
All I want to know

114
00:05:27,750 --> 00:05:28,390
is what exactly

115
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:29,450
happened that day.

116
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:30,840
Have you asked Lyu Siyi?

117
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:32,890
She said she never touched that mat.

118
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:34,390
And you believe her just because

119
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:35,590
she's your daughter?

120
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,510
I didn't touch that mat.

121
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:40,950
And I didn't snitch either.

122
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:43,880
What if your daughter is the one lying?

123
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,280
What will you do then?

124
00:06:03,870 --> 00:06:04,600
Captain Lyu.

125
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,800
How did you get in here?

126
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,800
The door was open.

127
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,180
I talked to Wang Danni.

128
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,730
What did she say?

129
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:20,950
"Go away."

130
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:22,920
No, no!

131
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,120
She told me to go away.

132
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:26,480
Has it ever crossed your mind

133
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,610
that this is just a misunderstanding?

134
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,380
Wang Danni didn't lie.

135
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,409
Your daughter was indeed wronged.

136
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,630
If that's really the case,

137
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:34,620
this burden can be lifted

138
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:35,720
from their hearts for good.

139
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,650
From yours, too.

140
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:45,720
Your daughter

141
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,510
refuses to talk to you, doesn't she?

142
00:06:47,510 --> 00:06:48,640
Just like her, I also

143
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:50,210
hate talking to my dad.

144
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,190
Perhaps she'll be

145
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:53,850
willing to tell me something.

146
00:07:10,670 --> 00:07:17,230
[Delivery Room]

147
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,160
Ding Rui's family?

148
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:23,830
Here I am.

149
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,860
How's it going?

150
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:26,390
She gave birth to a girl
who weighs 3.35 kg. They're both fine.

151
00:07:26,390 --> 00:07:27,270
They're both fine now, right?

152
00:07:27,270 --> 00:07:27,560
Yes.

153
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,120
Honey, I'm proud of you!

154
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,270
Honey, I love you!

155
00:07:30,290 --> 00:07:30,920
Sir, sir.

156
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:32,150
Sorry for that.

157
00:07:32,150 --> 00:07:32,750
We got it.

158
00:07:33,070 --> 00:07:33,390
Dad.

159
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:33,870
Keep it down.

160
00:07:33,870 --> 00:07:35,140
Dad, they're both fine.

161
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:36,510
Dad, I'm a father now too.

162
00:07:36,510 --> 00:07:37,190
You're a father now.

163
00:07:37,190 --> 00:07:38,310
And you're a grandfather.

164
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:39,370
This is marvelous.

165
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:41,040
Now I have two sweethearts.

166
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,090
Wh-When can we get in there?

167
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:44,950
May I go in?

168
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,950
-Come on.
-Congratulations.

169
00:07:46,950 --> 00:07:48,800
Congrats, Mr. Lu. Come on.

170
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:50,310
-Cheers.
-Congratulations.

171
00:07:50,310 --> 00:07:51,360
-Such good news.
-Congratulations.

172
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,090
I'll down it.

173
00:07:54,909 --> 00:07:55,510
He really did.

174
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:57,440
What a good drinker you are, Mr. Lu.

175
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,260
-Bravo!
-You can really hold your liquor.

176
00:07:59,260 --> 00:08:00,360
You're so different now that you have

177
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:00,830
a daughter.

178
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:01,720
Of course!

179
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:03,440
I'm telling you,

180
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,600
right now,

181
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,450
I look down on all of you.

182
00:08:07,810 --> 00:08:09,790
I contempt you in every way.

183
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,320
You're a bunch of stinky men!

184
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,100
I also have a daughter.

185
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,160
Listen,

186
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,010
the worst is yet to come.

187
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:21,560
Little girls can be quite a challenge!

188
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,360
Challenge?

189
00:08:23,830 --> 00:08:24,680
I'd love that!

190
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,560
I'd love that.

191
00:08:28,510 --> 00:08:28,970
Come on.

192
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:29,850
Cheers.

193
00:08:31,060 --> 00:08:32,080
-Come on.
-What about you?

194
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,330
Won't you make some plans?

195
00:08:33,330 --> 00:08:34,929
I'll take what fate gives me.

196
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:37,549
If it's meant to be, it will be.

197
00:08:37,549 --> 00:08:39,210
Everyone, please quiet down.

198
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:42,270
I have some good news to announce.

199
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:43,610
It's...

200
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:44,960
about me.

201
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,240
I have

202
00:08:47,030 --> 00:08:48,510
officially taken office

203
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:52,290
as Guangdong Dingxin Trading Group's

204
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:55,750
chief legal advisor in this province.

205
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,440
I'll be working

206
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:59,340
in Nanyun Building in Nanlu.

207
00:08:59,340 --> 00:09:01,120
If you ever visit the provincial capital,

208
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,320
come have tea with me.

209
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,400
You're welcome anytime.

210
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:05,680
Easy on it.

211
00:09:05,790 --> 00:09:07,750
You're always welcome anytime.

212
00:09:10,870 --> 00:09:11,600
Come on!

213
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:12,510
Qin,

214
00:09:13,190 --> 00:09:13,840
congratulations.

215
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:14,740
Guys, get up now.

216
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:15,310
Come on.

217
00:09:15,670 --> 00:09:17,530
Good things come in pairs, right?

218
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:18,720
Guys, let's toast to Qin.

219
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,360
Sure thing.

220
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,030
One more sip, guys.

221
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:20,560
Let's do.

222
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:22,000
Qin, you must take a big sip.

223
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,800
-Okay.
-Sure.

224
00:09:29,150 --> 00:09:30,010
What happened?

225
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,720
He met a big shot.

226
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:33,990
Zeming.

227
00:09:35,020 --> 00:09:36,290
Mr. Li and I parted ways

228
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,960
on amicable terms.

229
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,750
Mr. Li and the law firm

230
00:09:42,170 --> 00:09:43,370
treated me quite well

231
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:45,030
in the past years.

232
00:09:45,870 --> 00:09:46,400
Li Xiang.

233
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:47,560
Thank you.

234
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,780
Let's have a drink.

235
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:49,340
Sure.

236
00:09:49,590 --> 00:09:50,050
Come on!

237
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,100
Sure. Let's do.

238
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:52,150
Count me in as well.

239
00:09:52,150 --> 00:09:52,610
Come on.

240
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,390
Cheers, the three of us.

241
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:54,150
Congrats, Qin.

242
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:54,750
Congrats, Qin.

243
00:09:54,750 --> 00:09:55,210
Thanks.

244
00:10:01,270 --> 00:10:02,600
Whose phone is ringing?

245
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:03,290
Is it yours?

246
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,660
How am I able to afford a phone?

247
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,460
Then...

248
00:10:13,650 --> 00:10:15,110
Sorry, I need to take this.

249
00:10:16,710 --> 00:10:17,240
Hello?

250
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,090
Hey, Ms. Gui.

251
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,720
Yes, yes.

252
00:10:21,170 --> 00:10:23,630
I'll report for duty
the day after tomorrow.

253
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,510
I've found an apartment.

254
00:10:25,510 --> 00:10:27,370
Two bedrooms and one living room.

255
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:31,360
Thank you for your concern, Ms. Gui.

256
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,090
Thanks a lot.

257
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,550
See you the day after tomorrow then.

258
00:10:34,550 --> 00:10:35,510
Sure. Okay.

259
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:36,390
Goodbye.

260
00:10:40,550 --> 00:10:42,960
The company insisted on
providing me with a phone,

261
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:45,020
saying the fees would be reimbursed.

262
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,700
-Great.
-Good for you.

263
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:47,610
Mr. Qin.

264
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:48,480
What

265
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,550
brand is it?

266
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:50,670
A huge brand.

267
00:10:51,030 --> 00:10:52,030
That phone costs over ten grand.

268
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:52,630
Ten grand?

269
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:54,390
No, no.

270
00:10:55,150 --> 00:10:55,750
The brand

271
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:58,150
is called Svoboda.

272
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,840
S-S...

273
00:11:00,170 --> 00:11:01,100
What?

274
00:11:02,150 --> 00:11:02,870
Svoboda.

275
00:11:03,390 --> 00:11:04,190
Come on, guys.

276
00:11:04,390 --> 00:11:05,870
A toast to Svoboda.

277
00:11:05,890 --> 00:11:08,320
Sure. Svoboda.

278
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,650
Why are you eating that, Diandian?

279
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,030
Didn't I tell you to go find Tongtong

280
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:17,890
at Uncle Yin's?

281
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,000
Tongtong got sick.

282
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,510
Uncle Yin had to take her to the hospital,

283
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,870
so he sent me home first.

284
00:11:25,310 --> 00:11:26,670
This is not a proper meal, you know?

285
00:11:26,670 --> 00:11:29,480
Your stomach will be upset
if you eat too much of this.

286
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,310
What would you like to have?
Noodles, alright?

287
00:11:31,310 --> 00:11:31,970
With an egg?

288
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:33,670
Wait a moment then.

289
00:11:33,670 --> 00:11:35,080
Stop watching TV.
Read a book instead.

290
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:35,540
Come on.

291
00:11:35,550 --> 00:11:36,120
Okay.

292
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,290
I'll let you know when the food's ready.

293
00:11:38,290 --> 00:11:39,180
Okay.

294
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:51,800
Dinner's ready, Diandian.

295
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,440
Diandian.

296
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,390
Dad, Dad!

297
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:57,720
Is this you?

298
00:11:59,160 --> 00:11:59,450
Yes.

299
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,810
It's me when I was young.

300
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,330
What about this lady?

301
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,200
Is it Mom when she was young?

302
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,550
No, it's not your mom.

303
00:12:07,030 --> 00:12:07,790
Your mom looked exactly

304
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:09,320
like you when she was young.

305
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:11,670
What a big egg.

306
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:12,850
It's hot.

307
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,060
It's me.

308
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:39,550
You have the supplementary materials

309
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:41,350
from the procuratorate, right?

310
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:44,000
Place them on my desk tomorrow.

311
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,930
I'll take a look.

312
00:13:02,150 --> 00:13:03,950
[Beijing O&M Advertising Co., Ltd.]

313
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:53,780
Qiuyue.

314
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:57,320
Why are you eating leftovers again?

315
00:13:57,790 --> 00:13:58,920
Look at you, overweight.

316
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,850
It's caused by your eating habits.

317
00:14:02,270 --> 00:14:03,200
You haven't spoken

318
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:05,400
a proper sentence to me for over a month.

319
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:08,600
You're leaving tomorrow.

320
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,310
Why don't you say a few more words?

321
00:14:10,310 --> 00:14:11,390
Scold me if you want.

322
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:12,850
It'll make me feel better.

323
00:14:16,510 --> 00:14:17,150
Qin!

324
00:14:20,030 --> 00:14:21,000
If I had agreed

325
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:22,600
to divorce you back then,

326
00:14:22,870 --> 00:14:23,670
would you be living

327
00:14:23,670 --> 00:14:24,960
a better life now?

328
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:29,670
I...

329
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:31,810
I apologize to you.

330
00:14:32,470 --> 00:14:34,130
I reflect upon my wrongdoing.

331
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:36,730
I promise to treat you well from now on.

332
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:40,550
Can you please not see

333
00:14:40,570 --> 00:14:41,900
that female boss again?

334
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,320
Svoboda.

335
00:15:02,910 --> 00:15:04,770
Did I allow you to touch my things?

336
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,850
Are you illiterate or what?

337
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,390
All messed up, huh?

338
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:10,630
Leave them there.

339
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:12,640
I'll tidy them up for you later.

340
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:42,440
Speak up.

341
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,790
I agree with Court Pre. Yu.

342
00:15:47,270 --> 00:15:49,000
The death penalty is a fitting sentence.

343
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,240
The evidence is conclusive,

344
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,570
and the facts are clear.

345
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:00,100
Xia Yingjie, why are you so quiet?

346
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:02,770
Don't you always speak your mind?

347
00:16:03,910 --> 00:16:05,440
I'm gathering my thoughts.

348
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,880
Isn't it even necessary?

349
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:08,840
Court Pre. Yu is highly professional.

350
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:10,760
He can pick up on what's not being said.

351
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:12,290
Just say it if you disagree.

352
00:16:12,550 --> 00:16:14,610
Fine, I'll be straightforward then.

353
00:16:14,610 --> 00:16:16,000
There are quite many doubts.

354
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,270
I'll start with the major aspects

355
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:18,800
before we get into details.

356
00:16:19,550 --> 00:16:20,080
First,

357
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,360
the motive.

358
00:16:21,790 --> 00:16:22,750
It's unreasonable

359
00:16:22,750 --> 00:16:23,750
and far-fetched.

360
00:16:24,180 --> 00:16:25,660
Second, the murder weapon.

361
00:16:25,660 --> 00:16:26,920
It was not at the scene,

362
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:28,830
not thrown away or buried,

363
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:29,910
but taken home.

364
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,020
This is odd.

365
00:16:36,030 --> 00:16:36,600
Third,

366
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:38,510
the origins of the bloodstains

367
00:16:38,510 --> 00:16:40,270
on the clothes are questionable.

368
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:40,790
Fourth,

369
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:42,470
the time of the crime.

370
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,000
Hu can neither be established guilty,

371
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:45,460
nor ruled out as a suspect.

372
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:47,950
Fifth, the confessions.

373
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:49,970
They are the most problematic.

374
00:16:50,390 --> 00:16:51,200
Obviously, Hu was exhausted

375
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:53,200
on purpose when being interrogated.

376
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,790
According to the transcripts,

377
00:16:54,790 --> 00:16:55,750
the first interview

378
00:16:55,750 --> 00:16:56,880
lasted for 11 hours.

379
00:16:57,550 --> 00:16:58,630
After a half-hour break,

380
00:16:58,630 --> 00:17:00,510
it continued for another 11 hours.

381
00:17:00,510 --> 00:17:01,080
It went on and on.

382
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:03,010
Even a man of iron couldn't take it.

383
00:17:04,589 --> 00:17:05,280
Besides,

384
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:08,200
there are three confessions in total.

385
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,260
Hu denied doing the crime initially.

386
00:17:10,589 --> 00:17:11,510
The second and third confessions

387
00:17:11,510 --> 00:17:13,180
show gradual alignment with the facts.

388
00:17:13,180 --> 00:17:14,980
He was probably induced to them,

389
00:17:15,310 --> 00:17:16,640
or he was just too tired.

390
00:17:18,990 --> 00:17:20,020
Then do you think

391
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,200
it is likely for the defendant

392
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,550
to retract his confessions in court?

393
00:17:22,550 --> 00:17:23,410
It's possible.

394
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:26,420
It depends on
what the defender opts for.

395
00:17:27,349 --> 00:17:28,109
Then just make

396
00:17:28,109 --> 00:17:29,570
the defender give up on it.

397
00:17:32,270 --> 00:17:34,070
I brought a can of tea from the car.

398
00:17:34,070 --> 00:17:35,930
Make some nice tea for them later.

399
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:37,350
Okay.

400
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,860
What time is the appointment?

401
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,060
In ten minutes.

402
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:43,480
Okay.

403
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,350
I'll be on watch

404
00:17:45,350 --> 00:17:46,350
at the door later.

405
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:47,690
On watch?

406
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,510
This is not a spy mission.

407
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:51,550
What's that for?

408
00:17:51,550 --> 00:17:52,880
You're making me nervous.

409
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,080
Safety first, right?

410
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:57,680
Lihui.

411
00:17:59,310 --> 00:18:00,200
Can you not bring divorce again

412
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:02,030
without careful consideration?

413
00:18:02,030 --> 00:18:03,290
Not even when we argue,

414
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,280
unless you truly want a divorce.

415
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:06,590
Sorry.

416
00:18:07,410 --> 00:18:08,310
I was just afraid...

417
00:18:08,310 --> 00:18:10,040
I don't fear being implicated.

418
00:18:11,550 --> 00:18:12,480
At worst, we can always go sell

419
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,960
rice noodles somewhere else.

420
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,110
I'll take Guiya as my teacher

421
00:18:15,110 --> 00:18:16,300
and learn the craft from her.

422
00:18:16,300 --> 00:18:17,200
You'll be spared from labor.

423
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,070
Collecting payment

424
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,270
will be your only job.

425
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:21,620
Okay, I'll remember that.

426
00:18:25,210 --> 00:18:26,650
Easy with the talk later.

427
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,900
Don't say anything you shouldn't say.

428
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:29,700
What are you talking about? I...

429
00:18:29,830 --> 00:18:31,220
You think your wife is that stupid?

430
00:18:31,220 --> 00:18:33,240
For what it's worth, I'm a Doctor of Law.

431
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:33,770
Alright.

432
00:18:34,270 --> 00:18:36,530
I'll stand guard for you then, Dr. Zhang.

433
00:18:57,750 --> 00:18:59,150
What did you mean by that?

434
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:01,110
Why did you say

435
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:02,970
"make the defender give up on it"?

436
00:19:05,310 --> 00:19:06,830
Have you seen the supplementary evidence?

437
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:07,160
Yes.

438
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:08,640
Many questions

439
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:10,100
still remain unanswered.

440
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:24,720
I'm trying to say

441
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:25,750
that the glove alone

442
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:27,550
can prove Hu Xudong to be guilty.

443
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,480
There is indeed blood on it,

444
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:31,070
but the blood type can't be identified.

445
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:32,790
How can you be so sure that it's his?

446
00:19:32,790 --> 00:19:34,120
There are bloodstains.

447
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,830
And it was found

448
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:37,790
near the crime scene.

449
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:39,850
It is also identical to the one
at Hu's home.

450
00:19:39,850 --> 00:19:41,110
They fit them perfectly well.

451
00:19:41,110 --> 00:19:42,050
All these coincidences

452
00:19:42,050 --> 00:19:43,050
are now gathered.

453
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:54,480
What are your true thoughts?

454
00:19:54,510 --> 00:19:55,960
My true thoughts don't matter.

455
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,620
What matters is the evidence.

456
00:19:58,640 --> 00:19:59,960
From the very beginning,

457
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:00,750
the police have determined

458
00:20:00,750 --> 00:20:02,510
that Hu Xudong committed the crime.

459
00:20:02,510 --> 00:20:04,130
It's a typical act of deriving evidence
from confessions.

460
00:20:04,130 --> 00:20:04,590
So what?

461
00:20:06,750 --> 00:20:08,210
How else to solve the case?

462
00:20:09,590 --> 00:20:10,250
Yu Gaoyuan.

463
00:20:13,110 --> 00:20:15,570
You've changed quite a lot
over these years.

464
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:31,330
Court Pres. Qiu.

465
00:20:31,490 --> 00:20:32,420
Finished lunch?

466
00:20:34,550 --> 00:20:36,080
Is he well-suited to handle

467
00:20:36,350 --> 00:20:37,200
Hu Xudong's case?

468
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:38,800
There had better be no slips.

469
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,130
Should it be handled by you, if not him?

470
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:46,790
I'd really love to contribute
to the court.

471
00:20:46,790 --> 00:20:47,590
But I'm about to attend training

472
00:20:47,590 --> 00:20:48,830
at the Party School, right?

473
00:20:48,830 --> 00:20:50,830
I just don't have time for this case.

474
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:51,810
That being said,

475
00:20:52,310 --> 00:20:54,640
I'll absolutely follow
the organization's arrangements.

476
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,830
If he's recommended
for training at the Party School,

477
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:58,290
I'll be fully supportive.

478
00:21:00,310 --> 00:21:01,970
You think he'd be interested?

479
00:21:03,110 --> 00:21:04,440
I heard that he has recently

480
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,110
sent an application

481
00:21:05,110 --> 00:21:07,310
to the Advanced Training Center for Judges
in Beijing.

482
00:21:07,310 --> 00:21:08,720
He's been actively in touch with

483
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:09,780
the Supreme Court.

484
00:21:10,740 --> 00:21:12,130
I guess before long,

485
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,600
he'll become our leader.

486
00:21:14,110 --> 00:21:14,550
I see.

487
00:21:15,510 --> 00:21:16,080
No wonder

488
00:21:16,110 --> 00:21:16,640
when I went to

489
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:18,040
his office a few days ago,

490
00:21:18,280 --> 00:21:19,680
he was reading English newspapers

491
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:21,280
and memorizing vocabulary.

492
00:21:22,410 --> 00:21:23,320
A small temple

493
00:21:23,350 --> 00:21:25,010
is no place for a great Buddha.

494
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,070
His eyes

495
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:28,300
are set on Beijing.

496
00:21:28,550 --> 00:21:29,200
Why would he

497
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:30,200
care for this tiny

498
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:31,930
Binjiang Intermediate Court?

499
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,030
Room 1112.

500
00:21:41,590 --> 00:21:42,520
This way, right?

501
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:52,560
Zhou Tong.

502
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:53,610
Please come in.

503
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:05,590
Have some tea.

504
00:22:05,590 --> 00:22:06,350
Thank you.

505
00:22:06,510 --> 00:22:07,240
Here you are.

506
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:07,640
Zhang,

507
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:08,830
he is who I told you about,

508
00:22:08,830 --> 00:22:09,630
a senior to me.

509
00:22:09,830 --> 00:22:11,510
I guarantee that he is absolutely

510
00:22:11,510 --> 00:22:12,310
trustworthy.

511
00:22:13,880 --> 00:22:15,240
Hello, my name is Zhang Lihui.

512
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,030
I used to be

513
00:22:16,110 --> 00:22:18,570
the resident prosecutor of Bieshan Prison.

514
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:19,820
I'm Zeng Qiang,

515
00:22:19,830 --> 00:22:21,200
a reporter for the Weekly.

516
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,660
Thank you for coming today.

517
00:22:22,660 --> 00:22:25,100
I'm a loyal reader of your paper.

518
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:26,100
Thanks.

519
00:22:26,750 --> 00:22:27,240
Although

520
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:28,720
the Weekly is just a local media outlet,

521
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:29,640
it does have some influence

522
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:30,590
nationwide.

523
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:31,830
I think it perfectly meets

524
00:22:31,830 --> 00:22:32,630
your demands.

525
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:37,200
Let's cut to the chase then.

526
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:41,110
I hope the article can be

527
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:42,900
as objective as possible.

528
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:44,510
It shouldn't incite emotions,

529
00:22:44,510 --> 00:22:46,400
distort or cherry-pick facts,

530
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:48,030
or take things out of context.

531
00:22:48,030 --> 00:22:49,960
It must not attack the socialist system,

532
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:51,030
the Party's leadership,

533
00:22:51,030 --> 00:22:53,430
the judicial system
or China's rule of law.

534
00:22:53,920 --> 00:22:54,960
All I am trying to do is

535
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:57,490
draw the attention
of relevant departments.

536
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:59,290
There's another thing.

537
00:22:59,350 --> 00:23:00,160
When the draft is completed,

538
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:01,690
may I take a look at it first?

539
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:02,500
Yes, of course.

540
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:05,300
You're even qualified
to be our editor-in-chief.

541
00:23:05,880 --> 00:23:07,270
Zhang, it's a compliment for you.

542
00:23:07,270 --> 00:23:07,790
The words just

543
00:23:07,790 --> 00:23:08,750
came out weirdly.

544
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:09,960
D-Did I put my foot

545
00:23:09,980 --> 00:23:10,980
in my mouth again?

546
00:23:11,470 --> 00:23:12,160
No, no.

547
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:12,750
I...

548
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,070
I'm really sorry, Prosecutor Zhang.

549
00:23:14,070 --> 00:23:14,640
You see,

550
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:15,900
I completely understand

551
00:23:15,900 --> 00:23:17,440
why you are anxious and stressed.

552
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:17,920
So...

553
00:23:18,350 --> 00:23:20,640
I'm not anxious or stressed.

554
00:23:21,100 --> 00:23:23,630
I just hope the article
can be published soon.

555
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,360
Or it will be too late.

556
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,000
Okay, let's not waste any time then.

557
00:23:32,570 --> 00:23:33,880
The recording will only serve

558
00:23:33,880 --> 00:23:35,000
as a reference for my article.

559
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:36,590
It won't be leaked to a third party.

560
00:23:36,590 --> 00:23:37,320
Is that okay?

561
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:39,480
Yes.

562
00:23:41,590 --> 00:23:42,450
Shall we begin?

563
00:23:59,560 --> 00:24:00,960
Am I going to be executed?

564
00:24:07,070 --> 00:24:07,960
I think we stand

565
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:10,620
a higher chance if we fight for

566
00:24:10,750 --> 00:24:12,280
a suspended death penalty.

567
00:24:16,270 --> 00:24:18,130
Still a suspended death penalty?

568
00:24:20,350 --> 00:24:20,750
Yes.

569
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,550
First offense of casual nature.

570
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:24,960
A killing in the heat of passion.

571
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:26,160
You admitted guilt with a good attitude

572
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,880
and actively offered compensate.

573
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:30,350
These are grounds
for a suspended death penalty.

574
00:24:30,350 --> 00:24:31,610
Just tell me straight.

575
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:35,310
If...

576
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,680
I don't get executed,

577
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:40,650
how many years will I have to serve?

578
00:24:41,720 --> 00:24:42,580
About 20 years.

579
00:24:46,310 --> 00:24:47,110
Twenty years.

580
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:49,950
By the time I am released,

581
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,420
I'll be about the same age

582
00:24:51,420 --> 00:24:52,290
as my dad is now.

583
00:24:53,880 --> 00:24:54,480
Hu Xudong.

584
00:24:56,550 --> 00:24:57,310
I can and I am

585
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:58,790
willing to plead

586
00:24:58,790 --> 00:24:59,850
not guilty for you.

587
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:02,920
What do you think?

588
00:25:04,750 --> 00:25:05,610
Let's go for it.

589
00:25:07,070 --> 00:25:08,600
Had better get over with it.

590
00:25:10,110 --> 00:25:11,570
I'm ready to take the risk.

591
00:25:26,160 --> 00:25:26,620
What's the case?

592
00:25:26,620 --> 00:25:27,070
Paraquat poisoning.

593
00:25:27,070 --> 00:25:28,330
Please let us through.

594
00:25:28,640 --> 00:25:29,550
How much did she take in?

595
00:25:29,550 --> 00:25:30,750
Not much, allegedly.

596
00:25:31,270 --> 00:25:32,330
When did it happen?

597
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:34,410
When did it happen?

598
00:25:34,410 --> 00:25:35,470
Last night at 11...

599
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:38,400
Gastric lavage with 2% sodium bicarbonate.

600
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:38,740
Got it.

601
00:25:38,740 --> 00:25:40,600
Hurry, 5,000 milliliters first.

602
00:26:11,590 --> 00:26:13,390
Where did you buy the pesticide?

603
00:26:15,640 --> 00:26:18,440
The c-county agricultural supply
corporation's

604
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:20,240
retail store near the city gate.

605
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:23,920
Just the one next to
the long-distance coach station.

606
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:24,980
When did you buy it?

607
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:27,860
The day before yesterday.

608
00:26:28,270 --> 00:26:29,240
I bought it when I got off

609
00:26:29,240 --> 00:26:30,400
the bus from Nanlu.

610
00:26:31,680 --> 00:26:33,140
Why did you buy pesticide?

611
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:35,970
Because I wanted to die.

612
00:26:42,310 --> 00:26:43,270
Okay. Sure.

613
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:44,510
Come find me

614
00:26:44,510 --> 00:26:46,770
at Nanyun Building if you need anything.

615
00:26:47,350 --> 00:26:48,000
Good. Okay.

616
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,510
Alright, let's talk when we meet up.

617
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:50,680
What is it with you?

618
00:26:52,350 --> 00:26:52,810
This...

619
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,290
This one's the same.

620
00:27:02,720 --> 00:27:03,200
Ms. Gui!

621
00:27:07,350 --> 00:27:08,150
Do not come in.

622
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:11,450
Let's talk outside.

623
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:12,270
Outside.

624
00:27:13,820 --> 00:27:14,350
Okay.

625
00:27:34,350 --> 00:27:34,810
Ms. Gui,

626
00:27:36,110 --> 00:27:37,040
are you alright?

627
00:27:38,920 --> 00:27:40,050
This is all my fault.

628
00:27:41,750 --> 00:27:43,280
What are you talking about?

629
00:27:44,110 --> 00:27:44,970
You don't know?

630
00:27:45,680 --> 00:27:46,410
I don't know.

631
00:27:49,590 --> 00:27:50,110
Anyway,

632
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:52,500
please forgive me.

633
00:27:53,750 --> 00:27:55,000
Due to

634
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:56,800
unforeseen circumstances,

635
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:59,360
my company has to terminate your contract.

636
00:27:59,880 --> 00:28:00,590
So...

637
00:28:02,970 --> 00:28:04,270
But you'll still receive

638
00:28:04,270 --> 00:28:05,470
this month's salary,

639
00:28:05,510 --> 00:28:06,030
in cash.

640
00:28:06,510 --> 00:28:07,310
No tax needed.

641
00:28:08,590 --> 00:28:09,350
Just take it.

642
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:14,350
But the phone I gave you earlier

643
00:28:14,510 --> 00:28:15,710
is company property.

644
00:28:16,250 --> 00:28:17,250
Please return it.

645
00:28:24,550 --> 00:28:25,280
Thanks a lot.

646
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:27,420
Let's keep in touch.

647
00:28:27,420 --> 00:28:28,070
Actually, let's not.

648
00:28:28,070 --> 00:28:28,530
Ms. Gui!

649
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:30,260
Why is this happening?

650
00:28:31,760 --> 00:28:32,910
I'm running a business here.

651
00:28:32,910 --> 00:28:34,310
I don't want any trouble.

652
00:28:34,550 --> 00:28:35,810
Sorry for everything.

653
00:28:37,510 --> 00:28:37,970
Ms. Gui!

654
00:28:39,240 --> 00:28:39,700
Ms. Gui!

655
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:40,960
Ms. Gui,

656
00:28:41,330 --> 00:28:42,510
it's fine that you sacked me,

657
00:28:42,510 --> 00:28:43,270
but you should at least

658
00:28:43,270 --> 00:28:44,730
tell me the reason, right?

659
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:46,070
Your wife came stir up trouble yesterday.

660
00:28:46,070 --> 00:28:47,600
Do you really not know that?

661
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:50,080
She spewed tons of nonsense.

662
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,310
Anyway, she just hates

663
00:28:51,310 --> 00:28:52,310
you working here.

664
00:28:52,610 --> 00:28:54,640
She not only smashed
the door of the company,

665
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:55,920
but also scratched my face.

666
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:57,170
She's insane.

667
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,930
Take her to the doctor already!

668
00:28:59,070 --> 00:29:00,160
I'm terribly sorry, Ms. Gui.

669
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:01,000
I swear to you—

670
00:29:01,160 --> 00:29:02,160
I swear to you on my life

671
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:04,420
that she won't cause trouble here again!

672
00:29:04,580 --> 00:29:06,000
She also drank pesticide.

673
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:06,800
A big bottle of it.

674
00:29:06,800 --> 00:29:08,070
Everyone was terrified.

675
00:29:08,070 --> 00:29:09,550
I immediately called an ambulance.

676
00:29:09,550 --> 00:29:10,810
Then, she just ran off.

677
00:29:11,310 --> 00:29:12,310
Is she okay?

678
00:29:12,750 --> 00:29:13,550
She drank Paraquat,

679
00:29:13,550 --> 00:29:14,310
didn't she?

680
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:17,160
How would I know what the hell she drank?

681
00:29:17,160 --> 00:29:18,270
That was just a bluff.

682
00:29:18,270 --> 00:29:19,270
She was faking it.

683
00:29:19,350 --> 00:29:20,610
I promise that she will

684
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:22,480
absolutely never come here again.

685
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:24,350
-I guarantee that with my life.
-Mr. Qin,

686
00:29:24,350 --> 00:29:25,550
I'm a businesswoman.

687
00:29:25,620 --> 00:29:27,620
I'd rather stay out of such trouble.

688
00:29:27,750 --> 00:29:28,410
That's all.

689
00:29:30,270 --> 00:29:31,200
Crazy woman.

690
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,400
Why does your wife carry

691
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:37,110
fake pesticide with her all the time?

692
00:29:37,110 --> 00:29:38,910
She often quarrels with others,

693
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:39,880
makes a scene,

694
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:41,810
and scares them.

695
00:29:42,510 --> 00:29:44,550
Did you buy a bottle of real pesticide

696
00:29:44,550 --> 00:29:45,670
to swap with hers?

697
00:29:46,070 --> 00:29:47,470
I meant to drink it myself

698
00:29:48,590 --> 00:29:49,790
right in front of her.

699
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:52,350
Then how did it end up

700
00:29:52,350 --> 00:29:53,410
being taken by her?

701
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:55,200
Did you force it down her throat

702
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:56,860
or trick her into drinking it?

703
00:30:00,090 --> 00:30:01,490
I'm fed up with this life!

704
00:30:07,240 --> 00:30:08,770
You love playing dead, huh?

705
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,920
H-How could you do that?

706
00:30:11,830 --> 00:30:12,720
You want to die, huh?

707
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:13,200
Fine.

708
00:30:14,590 --> 00:30:15,960
You'll have to die today!

709
00:30:15,960 --> 00:30:17,420
Will you drink this or not?

710
00:30:17,860 --> 00:30:18,720
You won't, huh?

711
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:20,690
I will drink it if you don't!

712
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:24,110
I'll drink it!

713
00:30:24,540 --> 00:30:25,430
Let me die!

714
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:27,510
Let me die!

715
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:29,200
Give it back to me!

716
00:30:50,600 --> 00:30:52,530
How much pesticide did she take in?

717
00:30:53,270 --> 00:30:55,270
I'm not sure about the exact amount.

718
00:30:55,750 --> 00:30:56,720
Do you know how much

719
00:30:56,720 --> 00:30:57,200
5 ml is?

720
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:02,580
Just this much.

721
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:04,490
And it's enough to kill.

722
00:31:06,070 --> 00:31:07,590
I meant to drink it myself,

723
00:31:08,640 --> 00:31:10,040
but she snatched it away.

724
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:11,840
She snatched it away?

725
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:14,350
Then why did you say you committed murder

726
00:31:14,350 --> 00:31:15,950
when you turned yourself in?

727
00:31:17,110 --> 00:31:18,310
I did commit murder.

728
00:31:23,590 --> 00:31:25,510
Let me take you to the hospital.

729
00:31:26,800 --> 00:31:29,860
So you still can't bear to leave me alone.

730
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:36,400
Let's make a good life together
from now on.

731
00:31:38,920 --> 00:31:39,880
When Xiaowen is back,

732
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:42,280
let's start a wonderful new life together.

733
00:31:42,310 --> 00:31:43,710
We will never part again.

734
00:31:48,150 --> 00:31:48,890
So you waited

735
00:31:48,920 --> 00:31:49,720
several hours

736
00:31:49,960 --> 00:31:50,880
before sending her to the hospital,

737
00:31:50,880 --> 00:31:51,280
right?

738
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:54,550
She threw up the pesticide,

739
00:31:55,110 --> 00:31:57,440
and I proposed to take her
to the hospital.

740
00:31:58,720 --> 00:32:00,120
But she said she was fine.

741
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:05,540
Little did I expect her condition

742
00:32:07,110 --> 00:32:08,640
to worsen the next morning.

743
00:32:10,960 --> 00:32:12,610
Prior to the purchase of the pesticide,

744
00:32:12,610 --> 00:32:13,680
did you know about its toxicity

745
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:14,830
and the characteristics

746
00:32:14,830 --> 00:32:15,560
of its onset?

747
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:18,070
No, not really.

748
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:19,510
Qin Zhigao.

749
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:22,310
You bought the pesticide.

750
00:32:22,310 --> 00:32:23,910
She snatched it and drank it.

751
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:24,920
You don't know the amount she took in,

752
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:26,520
nor the toxicity of the drug.

753
00:32:28,200 --> 00:32:29,510
Are you trying to tell me

754
00:32:29,510 --> 00:32:31,770
that you turned yourself in out of guilt?

755
00:32:40,070 --> 00:32:41,830
How is my wife now?

756
00:32:42,090 --> 00:32:43,420
Has she pulled through?

757
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:44,790
Defendant,

758
00:33:44,790 --> 00:33:46,260
do you have objections
to the alleged charges

759
00:33:46,260 --> 00:33:47,320
in the indictment?

760
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:48,240
Yes, I do.

761
00:33:51,270 --> 00:33:52,070
I didn't kill.

762
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:54,530
I'm innocent.

763
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:55,720
Is it your signature

764
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:56,440
on the confessions?

765
00:33:56,440 --> 00:33:56,790
Yes.

766
00:33:57,360 --> 00:33:58,350
Did anyone resort to

767
00:33:58,350 --> 00:33:59,610
violence, like beatings,

768
00:33:59,610 --> 00:34:01,000
to force you to sign them?

769
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:01,400
No.

770
00:34:01,750 --> 00:34:02,810
No one interfered.

771
00:34:02,860 --> 00:34:04,120
No one threatened you.

772
00:34:04,170 --> 00:34:05,350
Then why did you sign the confessions

773
00:34:05,350 --> 00:34:06,790
before reading through the transcripts?

774
00:34:06,790 --> 00:34:07,640
At that time,

775
00:34:07,920 --> 00:34:09,250
I hadn't slept for days.

776
00:34:10,550 --> 00:34:11,810
I was not of sound mind.

777
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:19,179
I drank the pesticide myself.

778
00:34:20,960 --> 00:34:22,670
It had nothing to do with Qin.

779
00:34:24,590 --> 00:34:25,989
Please don't arrest him.

780
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:28,800
How is your relationship

781
00:34:28,800 --> 00:34:29,330
with him?

782
00:34:30,400 --> 00:34:31,620
Very good.

783
00:34:34,110 --> 00:34:35,960
Qin and I are chummy.

784
00:34:37,030 --> 00:34:39,090
Don't be fooled by others' nonsense.

785
00:34:39,630 --> 00:34:41,030
Please don't arrest him.

786
00:34:43,920 --> 00:34:45,070
Officers,

787
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:48,880
when can I be discharged
from the hospital?

788
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,860
I'd like to stay at home for recovery.

789
00:34:54,230 --> 00:34:56,360
The doctor won't give me an exact time.

790
00:34:58,160 --> 00:34:59,760
How long had you known Yin Ping,

791
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:00,480
the victim?

792
00:35:00,630 --> 00:35:01,890
Ever since we were kids.

793
00:35:01,890 --> 00:35:02,480
Then why did he

794
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:03,590
burn down your cowshed?

795
00:35:03,590 --> 00:35:04,340
Because he went crazy.

796
00:35:04,340 --> 00:35:05,550
I didn't provoke him anyway.

797
00:35:05,550 --> 00:35:06,880
How did you deal with it?

798
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:09,020
First, I reported it to the police,

799
00:35:09,360 --> 00:35:10,490
but they ignored it.

800
00:35:10,550 --> 00:35:12,030
Then I went to the courthouse.

801
00:35:12,030 --> 00:35:14,880
They said their hands were tied,
since he was a mental patient.

802
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:16,190
When all these departments

803
00:35:16,190 --> 00:35:16,920
failed to

804
00:35:16,940 --> 00:35:18,000
intervene with it,

805
00:35:18,440 --> 00:35:19,900
did you consider revenge?

806
00:35:20,190 --> 00:35:21,650
I was about to get married at that time.

807
00:35:21,650 --> 00:35:22,230
How did I have time

808
00:35:22,230 --> 00:35:23,760
to fight with a sick person?

809
00:35:23,840 --> 00:35:24,500
Defendant,

810
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:25,740
half a year ago,

811
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:27,030
you were taken to the police station

812
00:35:27,030 --> 00:35:28,230
due to a brawl, right?

813
00:35:28,710 --> 00:35:29,110
Yes.

814
00:35:30,590 --> 00:35:32,520
I brawled with a ticket conductor.

815
00:35:32,530 --> 00:35:33,760
He asked me to buy a ticket.

816
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:35,020
I said I had bought one.

817
00:35:35,280 --> 00:35:36,210
But he denied it.

818
00:35:36,330 --> 00:35:37,590
He's laying a trap for Hu Xudong.

819
00:35:37,590 --> 00:35:39,030
So I got into a fight with him.

820
00:35:39,030 --> 00:35:41,070
You stated that you were drunk
at that time.

821
00:35:41,070 --> 00:35:41,670
Is it true?

822
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:42,630
Yes.

823
00:35:43,230 --> 00:35:44,280
How much did you drink?

824
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:45,210
I just got drunk.

825
00:35:45,550 --> 00:35:46,800
I don't recall the amount.

826
00:35:46,800 --> 00:35:47,460
Objection.

827
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:48,840
Presiding Judge,

828
00:35:49,070 --> 00:35:49,880
the prosecutor's questions

829
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,410
are irrelevant to the case.

830
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:55,040
Prosecutor, limit your questions
to the case.

831
00:35:55,320 --> 00:35:56,400
On the night

832
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:58,050
of October 17, 1996,

833
00:35:58,430 --> 00:35:59,830
did you have any alcohol?

834
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:00,520
Yes, I did.

835
00:36:00,670 --> 00:36:01,870
So, just like before,

836
00:36:02,030 --> 00:36:02,810
you were drunk

837
00:36:02,810 --> 00:36:04,320
and couldn't control yourself.

838
00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:05,120
Is it correct?

839
00:36:05,150 --> 00:36:06,610
That's only your opinion.

840
00:36:06,880 --> 00:36:07,540
Objection!

841
00:36:07,590 --> 00:36:08,480
Presiding Judge,

842
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:09,230
the prosecutor

843
00:36:09,230 --> 00:36:10,630
is leading the defendant

844
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:11,960
with questions that are unrelated

845
00:36:11,960 --> 00:36:12,760
to the case.

846
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,010
Prosecutor.

847
00:36:14,590 --> 00:36:15,590
Presiding Judge,

848
00:36:15,630 --> 00:36:16,710
we're trying to figure out the following.

849
00:36:16,710 --> 00:36:17,110
First,

850
00:36:17,590 --> 00:36:18,550
on the night of the incident,

851
00:36:18,550 --> 00:36:19,150
did he or did he not...

852
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:20,400
What is the prosecutor trying to do?

853
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:20,860
Second,

854
00:36:21,110 --> 00:36:22,630
did he lose control again...

855
00:36:22,630 --> 00:36:23,110
It'll be fine.

856
00:36:23,110 --> 00:36:24,110
And use violence?

857
00:36:24,360 --> 00:36:26,220
Therefore, my questions just now

858
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:27,710
are not only relevant to the case,

859
00:36:27,710 --> 00:36:29,370
but also of great importance.

860
00:36:29,920 --> 00:36:31,110
The prosecutor cannot use

861
00:36:31,110 --> 00:36:32,650
the fact that the defendant once

862
00:36:32,650 --> 00:36:34,030
brawled with someone after drinking

863
00:36:34,030 --> 00:36:34,840
to prove

864
00:36:35,070 --> 00:36:36,510
that the defendant would commit

865
00:36:36,510 --> 00:36:38,440
violent acts every time he drinks.

866
00:36:39,800 --> 00:36:41,400
Pardon me for being blunt.

867
00:36:42,710 --> 00:36:43,800
We can adopt

868
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:45,320
all available measures.

869
00:36:45,910 --> 00:36:47,320
But she was brought in too late.

870
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:49,030
The window for resuscitation was missed.

871
00:36:49,030 --> 00:36:50,830
There are slim chances of saving

872
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:51,970
her life.

873
00:36:53,280 --> 00:36:54,960
I suggest you and your father discuss

874
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:56,290
whether to keep trying.

875
00:36:57,840 --> 00:36:58,700
It will cost...

876
00:36:59,590 --> 00:37:00,790
a great deal of money.

877
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:09,140
Defendant,

878
00:37:09,550 --> 00:37:11,110
on the day of the incident,
as you left

879
00:37:11,110 --> 00:37:12,650
Liu Erdong's place after drinking,

880
00:37:12,650 --> 00:37:13,910
what were you wearing?

881
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:15,920
I had a shirt on the inside,

882
00:37:16,710 --> 00:37:18,110
and a suit jacket on the outside.

883
00:37:18,110 --> 00:37:19,590
Did you mention this suit jacket

884
00:37:19,590 --> 00:37:20,510
to the police?

885
00:37:20,880 --> 00:37:21,800
Why wasn't it noted down

886
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:22,930
in the confessions?

887
00:37:22,960 --> 00:37:24,290
No one asked about that.

888
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:25,440
They spent

889
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:27,400
all the effort studying my shirt.

890
00:37:27,400 --> 00:37:28,800
Where is the suit jacket now?

891
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:29,690
It's hung at home.

892
00:37:29,690 --> 00:37:30,190
Presiding Judge,

893
00:37:30,190 --> 00:37:31,590
we request the immediate retrieval

894
00:37:31,590 --> 00:37:33,150
of the suit jacket
mentioned by the defendant

895
00:37:33,150 --> 00:37:33,940
as new physical evidence,

896
00:37:33,940 --> 00:37:35,740
and a test on it for bloodstains.

897
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:37,110
Noted by the court.

898
00:37:37,550 --> 00:37:38,210
Defendant,

899
00:37:38,510 --> 00:37:40,070
on the night of October 17th,

900
00:37:40,070 --> 00:37:40,840
when you left

901
00:37:40,840 --> 00:37:41,930
Liu Erdong's place

902
00:37:41,960 --> 00:37:42,670
for home,

903
00:37:43,190 --> 00:37:44,070
did you run into anyone

904
00:37:44,070 --> 00:37:44,670
on the way?

905
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:46,150
No.

906
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:48,710
During the supplementary investigation

907
00:37:48,710 --> 00:37:49,710
on November 19th,

908
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:51,510
this work glove was discovered

909
00:37:51,510 --> 00:37:53,230
near the scene of crime.

910
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,340
There are bloodstains on it.

911
00:37:55,340 --> 00:37:56,940
It's not written in the file.

912
00:37:57,440 --> 00:37:58,510
I told you so.

913
00:37:58,880 --> 00:38:00,280
They'd catch you off guard.

914
00:38:00,280 --> 00:38:02,140
This newly discovered work glove

915
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,880
forms a pair with the one found

916
00:38:04,880 --> 00:38:05,940
at the crime scene.

917
00:38:06,440 --> 00:38:08,770
The defendant tried them on, and they fit.

918
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:10,800
Presiding Judge.

919
00:38:10,960 --> 00:38:12,000
May I ask why

920
00:38:12,190 --> 00:38:13,550
this physical evidence and statement

921
00:38:13,550 --> 00:38:14,440
are not included

922
00:38:14,440 --> 00:38:15,370
in the case file?

923
00:38:16,190 --> 00:38:17,000
Prosecutor, how do you

924
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:17,800
explain this?

925
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:19,010
The evidence was newly obtained

926
00:38:19,010 --> 00:38:19,880
as the police conducted

927
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:21,670
a supplementary investigation.

928
00:38:21,670 --> 00:38:23,000
The time was so pressing

929
00:38:23,070 --> 00:38:25,000
that we couldn't put it in the file.

930
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:26,610
Well then...

931
00:38:27,020 --> 00:38:27,960
Presiding Judge,

932
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:30,070
the defense requests a short recess.

933
00:38:37,200 --> 00:38:37,840
Recess granted.

934
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:38,760
Everyone, take a lunch break.

935
00:38:38,760 --> 00:38:40,620
The court will resume at 2:00 p.m.

936
00:38:47,500 --> 00:38:48,030
Let's go.

937
00:38:48,190 --> 00:38:49,030
Go, Dad.

938
00:38:49,050 --> 00:38:49,460
Move.

939
00:38:52,110 --> 00:38:52,570
Xudong.

940
00:38:53,590 --> 00:38:54,050
Xudong.

941
00:38:54,550 --> 00:38:55,030
Xudong!

942
00:39:10,590 --> 00:39:11,520
Just so you know,

943
00:39:12,590 --> 00:39:14,320
we went to the hospital at noon.

944
00:39:16,960 --> 00:39:17,800
How is she?

945
00:39:22,670 --> 00:39:23,400
Still alive.

946
00:39:24,760 --> 00:39:26,890
The hospital said she needs dialysis.

947
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:31,730
How is your relationship with her?

948
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:32,960
Terrible.

949
00:39:36,670 --> 00:39:38,800
All my acquaintances know about her.

950
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:42,670
She's notorious.

951
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:45,520
Can you tell left from right?

952
00:39:46,180 --> 00:39:47,910
These gloves fit either hands.

953
00:39:47,930 --> 00:39:48,760
Do they fit?

954
00:39:49,550 --> 00:39:50,280
Yes. Look.

955
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:52,710
Can you tell left from right?

956
00:39:52,710 --> 00:39:53,710
These gloves work for both hands.

957
00:39:53,710 --> 00:39:54,550
Just put them on.

958
00:39:54,550 --> 00:39:55,210
Do they fit?

959
00:39:55,360 --> 00:39:55,840
Yes.

960
00:39:56,150 --> 00:39:56,800
This stuff fits nearly

961
00:39:56,800 --> 00:39:57,930
every pair of hands.

962
00:39:58,440 --> 00:40:00,240
Do they have front or back sides?

963
00:40:00,400 --> 00:40:01,150
No, I guess not.

964
00:40:01,150 --> 00:40:02,550
What's the point of that?

965
00:40:08,070 --> 00:40:09,360
Defense, what are you trying to illustrate

966
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:10,030
with these

967
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:11,030
video materials?

968
00:40:11,520 --> 00:40:13,590
The new physical evidence
provided by the prosecutor,

969
00:40:13,590 --> 00:40:15,390
namely a work glove of this sort,

970
00:40:15,550 --> 00:40:16,880
can be seen everywhere.

971
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:17,760
They're available

972
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:18,960
in several stores nearby.

973
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:20,190
And they are of the same type.

974
00:40:20,190 --> 00:40:21,030
One size fits all.

975
00:40:21,030 --> 00:40:22,070
Most importantly,

976
00:40:22,070 --> 00:40:23,240
such work gloves

977
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:24,300
fit both hands.

978
00:40:24,510 --> 00:40:25,310
That is to say,

979
00:40:25,550 --> 00:40:26,710
even two randomly found

980
00:40:26,710 --> 00:40:27,670
work gloves

981
00:40:28,030 --> 00:40:28,890
can make a pair.

982
00:40:29,880 --> 00:40:31,070
Defender, keep your remarks brief

983
00:40:31,070 --> 00:40:32,280
during the evidence-review stage.

984
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:33,960
We are trying to say

985
00:40:34,360 --> 00:40:35,320
that this physical evidence

986
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:37,280
has no direct connection to the case.

987
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:39,160
Besides, the crime scene is now
under construction.

988
00:40:39,160 --> 00:40:41,210
This glove very likely belongs to
one of the workers.

989
00:40:41,210 --> 00:40:42,030
We've investigated it.

990
00:40:42,030 --> 00:40:43,360
The workers on the site do not

991
00:40:43,360 --> 00:40:44,690
wear this kind of glove.

992
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:45,630
The possibility of it being

993
00:40:45,630 --> 00:40:46,590
left there still cannot be ruled out.

994
00:40:46,590 --> 00:40:48,110
On top of that, workers and villagers

995
00:40:48,110 --> 00:40:49,150
pass by that dry ditch

996
00:40:49,150 --> 00:40:50,010
all year round.

997
00:40:50,280 --> 00:40:50,880
In addition,

998
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:52,110
is it really human blood

999
00:40:52,110 --> 00:40:53,080
on that glove?

1000
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:54,760
Is that blood from the defendant

1001
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:55,560
or the victim?

1002
00:40:56,240 --> 00:40:57,480
The investigation authority has consulted

1003
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:59,010
professional institutions.

1004
00:40:59,010 --> 00:41:00,800
The blood can only be confirmed
to be from humans.

1005
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,440
The blood type cannot be identified.

1006
00:41:02,440 --> 00:41:03,400
That means it's not necessarily

1007
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:04,400
Yin Ping's blood,

1008
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:05,440
right?

1009
00:41:07,440 --> 00:41:08,440
Presiding Judge,

1010
00:41:08,670 --> 00:41:10,110
I request to ask the defendant

1011
00:41:10,110 --> 00:41:11,150
supplementary questions.

1012
00:41:11,150 --> 00:41:12,150
Request granted.

1013
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:14,140
Defendant,

1014
00:41:15,000 --> 00:41:16,860
do you recognize this work glove?

1015
00:41:16,870 --> 00:41:17,550
No.

1016
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:19,730
Every household

1017
00:41:19,930 --> 00:41:21,880
in the village
has gloves of sort for work.

1018
00:41:21,880 --> 00:41:23,320
Why would I recognize any?

1019
00:41:23,320 --> 00:41:24,760
Then why did the police

1020
00:41:25,230 --> 00:41:26,360
find only one glove

1021
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,210
at your home?

1022
00:41:27,320 --> 00:41:28,320
Where is the other one?

1023
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:30,120
Have you not lost a sock a before?

1024
00:41:30,450 --> 00:41:31,510
The defense rests.

1025
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:39,550
Yes, yes.

1026
00:41:39,840 --> 00:41:40,370
Exactly.

1027
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:42,440
This is also what I mean.

1028
00:41:42,550 --> 00:41:44,000
Just let him out for now.

1029
00:41:46,040 --> 00:41:47,450
If something truly

1030
00:41:47,480 --> 00:41:48,710
happens to his wife,

1031
00:41:49,490 --> 00:41:51,020
he won't be able to get away.

1032
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:53,660
Okay, good.

1033
00:41:54,590 --> 00:41:55,440
Thanks, Fan.

1034
00:41:56,400 --> 00:41:57,230
Goodbye.

1035
00:42:01,190 --> 00:42:01,570
Kid...

1036
00:42:01,570 --> 00:42:02,380
Be seated.

1037
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:05,570
Your father turned himself in.

1038
00:42:05,760 --> 00:42:07,360
The police have filed a case.

1039
00:42:07,630 --> 00:42:10,360
It's impossible to drop it
without proper cause.

1040
00:42:10,630 --> 00:42:11,230
That said,

1041
00:42:11,640 --> 00:42:13,320
the police can release him from detention

1042
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:14,290
through bail.

1043
00:42:14,670 --> 00:42:16,470
We'll have to play it by ear then.

1044
00:42:17,400 --> 00:42:18,550
I'll arrange for you

1045
00:42:19,110 --> 00:42:20,240
to pick him up later.

1046
00:42:21,700 --> 00:42:22,880
Thank you, Uncle Ding.

1047
00:42:22,880 --> 00:42:23,880
Thank you so much.

1048
00:42:26,280 --> 00:42:27,800
We reenacted the scene on the site

1049
00:42:27,800 --> 00:42:29,260
where the crime happened.

1050
00:42:29,680 --> 00:42:31,000
On the night of the incident,

1051
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:31,930
at about 11 p.m.,

1052
00:42:31,960 --> 00:42:33,190
in complete darkness,

1053
00:42:33,190 --> 00:42:34,990
it was nearly impossible to find

1054
00:42:35,110 --> 00:42:37,310
three shirt buttons in the pile of rocks

1055
00:42:37,440 --> 00:42:38,040
on the site

1056
00:42:38,070 --> 00:42:39,200
within a short time.

1057
00:42:40,550 --> 00:42:42,480
The moonlight is bright this season.

1058
00:42:42,480 --> 00:42:44,280
Visibility is high at night.

1059
00:42:44,830 --> 00:42:46,280
There are reports on the moon phase

1060
00:42:46,280 --> 00:42:47,480
and weather for the day.

1061
00:42:47,480 --> 00:42:48,880
On October 17th,

1062
00:42:48,880 --> 00:42:49,760
it was a crescent moon.

1063
00:42:49,760 --> 00:42:51,110
Only a quarter of the moon could be seen.

1064
00:42:51,110 --> 00:42:51,840
What's more,

1065
00:42:52,190 --> 00:42:53,320
the clouds were thick that night,

1066
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:54,380
covering the moon.

1067
00:42:54,400 --> 00:42:56,380
There are no streetlights
within 300 meters of the scene.

1068
00:42:56,380 --> 00:42:58,180
Let me put it this way, everyone.

1069
00:42:59,030 --> 00:43:00,030
It was too dark to even see one's fingers.
